fxirp.hpp: restore the head of class FxIrp

Microsoft's published fxirp.hpp has lines 22-86 blanked: the comment end,
the include guard and the start of class FxIrp (its member m_Irp and
constructors).  This restores them as the rest of the framework uses them.

diff --git a/src/framework/shared/inc/private/common/fxirp.hpp b/src/framework/shared/inc/private/common/fxirp.hpp
index 1c16fb5..f666478 100644
--- a/src/framework/shared/inc/private/common/fxirp.hpp
+++ b/src/framework/shared/inc/private/common/fxirp.hpp
@@ -19,43 +19,43 @@ Environment:
     Both kernel and user mode
 
 Revision History:
+--*/
 
